      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:d50kqz'
    '|a||Keep it: for Friedman the test is the predictions, and ten years of good forecasts pass it.':
